invariant: INV-26
file: quic_packet.c
catches: quic_suite_test
reason: quic_keys_select marks the 1-RTT receive set it chose as one with
  a stored schedule, though it copies none, so a host object opens every
  1-RTT packet under AES-GCM with round keys nothing wrote, and none
  opens. quic_suite_test, a host binary, opens AES-GCM 1-RTT packets
  through quic_packet_open_application.

--- old
    out->stored = 0;
--- new
    out->stored = 1;
